  "brain_first": "“转折前先记，转折后重新判断。”",
  "sort_order": 1013,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 584
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "材料出现 but, however, actually, instead, rather,",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 585
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "unfortunately, in fact。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 586
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 587
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "转折词说明说话人要纠正、限制或改变前面的信",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 588
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "息。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 589
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “转折前先记，转折后重新判断。”",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 590
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 高考常把转折前内容放进干扰项。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 591
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 592
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 听到转折词时在草稿上画“→”。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 593
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 比较转折前后哪个更接近题干要求。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 594
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 如果是“不是A而是B”，直接划掉A。",
      "sourcePage": 21,
      "sourceIndex": 595
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 若后面只是补充而非否定，保留两部分信息。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 596
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 题号旁只记最短符号：关键词 / old→new / + / - / ?。数字写成“30→25”，计",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 597
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "划写成“drive→sleep”；不要抄完整句。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 598
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 599
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· not A but B → 选B",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 600
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· planned A, but... → 看后面最终计划",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 601
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· good, but expensive → 总评价可能是 mixed，而不是纯 positive",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 602
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 转折后的信息已经完整表达最终立场/事实。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 603
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 没听清转折后具体词时，至少知道“前面那个答案需要降级”，再利用选项方",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 604
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "向排除。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 605
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 606
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I thought the lecture would be boring, but it turned out to be very practical.",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 607
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "最终态度是positive，不能选boring。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 608
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 609
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 把 but 前内容当最终答案。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 610
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看见 however 就机械认为后面一定是完全相反。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 611
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 612
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 转折是纠正、限制还是补充？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 613
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 最终立场在哪里？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 614
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： L-K 关键词漏听｜L-C 改口没更新｜L-P 同",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 615
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "义替换没认出｜L-I 推断过远｜L-A 态度对象/强度错。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 616
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 617
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 转折后重新算一次。",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 618
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 620
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. “I thought it was boring, but it was practical.”最终态度？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 621
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. not A but B，应选？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 622
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. however 后一定与前面完全相反吗？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 623
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 听到 actually 最该做？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 624
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. good but expensive，评价可能是？",
      "sourcePage": 22,
      "sourceIndex": 625
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. positive；2. B；3. 不一定，也可能限制/修正。；4. 准备更新前面的信息。；5. mixed，不能只取",
      "sourcePage": 23,
      "sourceIndex": 626
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "good。",
      "sourcePage": 23,
      "sourceIndex": 627
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— L10 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“L10”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 23,
      "sourceIndex": 628
    }
  ],
